// IntroString :
"P1200296080" "I must see your combat prowess for myself. I take it Caze explained how to use your powers, so let us put that knowledge to practical use. Go east from here, out into the Yard. Once there, defeat any two people. Prisoners, guards, I do not care. When you have defeated two, return to me.<br><br><color deepskyblue>If you are a Mastermind Archetype and have Summoning powers, you should read the manual, or the in-game Help File, for more information on how to control your pets in battle.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1458097698" "Click here to accept this task"
// SendOffString :
"P3982830312" "Defeat two people, I care not which ones, then return to me. You must leap over the fence in order to get into the Yard.<br><br><color deepskyblue>To leap over the fence, use your Spacebar to jump while moving forward.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - VTutorial3_Part1 
