"P928672176" "Defeat Thugs/Guards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2028414" "You are a fool and a coward. You need to prove yourself to me. Hop over the fence using your Spacebar and defeat two escaped prisoners or guards!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
