"P1667143033" ""What are you waiting for? Come back here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1378561123" "Take this time to look at your Experience Bar. <br><img src=Tut_v_Experience_Bar.tga><br>This fills up as you complete tasks and defeat foes. Once you fill up the Experience Bar, one of the small bars in the Information Circle will fill. Once all 10 bars are filled, you will increase your Combat Level. Then you can train at an Arbiter to increase your Threat level. <br><br>I hear there are those within Arachnos who think you have a bright destiny. But today, today you are but a gnat on the hind end of a mule. In order to truly succeed you will need to learn to use Inspirations in battle. You can use these Inspirations to temporarily increase your combat potential by raising your damage, accuracy or defense. Some Inspirations can be used to heal yourself or give you back some of your Endurance. To use an Inspiration, click on the icon in your Inspiration Tray: <br><br><img src=COV_ToolbarInspiration.tga><br><br>Armed with this knowledge, and some powerful Inspirations, <color yellow>go out and defeat 2 more people in the Yard.</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>You can also detach windows by clicking the button in the upper or lower left hand corner of the window, This will let you move them around your interface to customize it to your liking.</color><br><br><img src=COV_ToolbarDetach.tga><br><br>"

