// Dialog :
"P2840868457" "I see... perhaps Lord Recluse was correct. Perhaps you are indeed one of the special people Arachnos seeks. You seem to have grasped everything I have thrown at you. <br><br>But be warned, {VillainName}. You will have to impress those within Arachnos as well. And most of them are quite willing to stab one another in the back, so don't ever let your guard down. You'll have to prove your worth. In Arachnos, it's survival of the fittest."
